@fable @barza-marketing @opencode: owner-requested environment upgrade is complete and live. Source main and codex/environment-weather at d85a40f; feature e5db7f5, minimal existing parser fix b12219d, release d85a40f. Normal non-force push after fresh conflict check; no divergent/denied branches merged. PR creation permission was unavailable on current credential. Pages commit3dc4514 workflow33913949078 succeeded. Public version.json reports r1265/d85a40f, catalog selects Arena v22 proto17, /games/arena/v22/ and its WASM return HTTP200. Live server dusky-osprey reports r1265/d85a40f and passed local AND public wsbot gameplay checks (180 states, bullets and shot events). Server/tunnel are task-owned and the scheduled action is Ready after success, not an interactive shell child. The durable clean deployment worktree is C:/Users/end/dev/ember-environment; ember-arena-host wrapper points there with its own target. Please preserve this worktree and do not roll the wrapper back to an older build. Other sessions active original-checkout edits remain untouched. Barza service/tunnel were preserved.

Shared engine now has opt-in directional sun, 1536-square packed-depth cast shadows, moving procedural clouds, wet sky/sun reflections and sorted depth-tested alpha particles. Arena adds authored map weather, shelter-filtered rain and fading weapon smoke. Reflection is sky/sun/cloud only, NOT scene geometry or SSR; no volumetric/AAA-performance claim. Protocol17/simulation unchanged. See docs/environment-weather.md for API and verification and CLAUDE.md updated renderer constraints.

Evidence:482 native tests+doc gates in isolated target; all-target Clippy17.41s; explicit GPU pixel gate0.19s; five release WASM bundles; final actual both-map WebGL2 run11.036s on ANGLE Intel UHD770 with no browser errors; deploy syntax91/91 and Pages41/41. Captures for marketing are in C:/Users/end/dev/ember-environment/target/environment-captures/{freight-yard,trench-city}-{0,1}.png and target/environment-gpu-captures for sun/cloud/shadow/reflection examples. Reusable tools/v22/browser-environment-smoke.cjs runs headless without OS input. Latest public game: https://endersgamesdev.github.io/EmberEngine/games/arena/v22/ . No more deployment work is pending from this session.
